What this benchmark contains
----------------------------
This release contains DERIVED features computed from public Two-Line Element (TLE) data:
  * Pair feature vectors (range, range rate, relative speed, plane-alignment angle) 
    computed via SGP4 propagation.
  * Window metadata (NORAD IDs, timestamps, labels, source category).

This release does NOT contain raw TLE files. Raw TLE data is hosted at
https://www.space-track.org under their separate terms of service, which
prohibit redistribution of raw TLE files. Users who wish to rebuild the
benchmark from raw TLE must register a free Space-Track account and use
the data collection scripts provided in `data_collection/`.

